Z||000000||Richard Parnell||02-02-2000||03:00 PM||||I tried doing a search for info on the symptoms of a faulty TPS.  If I searched on TPS I got 4 items none of which mentioned the TPS but did contain tps within certain words.  If I searched on throttle postion sensor I got a not found message.  So here's what going on with my 87 4 banger presently.  If I accelerate with the pedal down hard the car accelerates at a fair clip, but when I let up partially on the gas the car suddenly takes off like it was kicked in the pants.  Is this a problem with the TPS or something else? It's a little bit disconcerting to have the car accelerate when I let off on the gas.  I'd like to have that acceleration "while" pressing down on the pedal.  BTW the car has a DIS type motor.||||reg||5
